EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,



Although we received your request for a reconciliation, we did not receive the bank statements required to process the request.  As a result, the reconciliation request has been closed in our system.  No further action is required.



Thank you,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
